// x64base application icon -- MSW resource script.
//
// The resource is NAMED rather than numbered because wxWidgets looks icons up
// by name: `wxIconBundle("x64base_icon", nullptr)` loads every size the .ico
// carries, and Explorer takes the first icon resource in the file for the
// executable. One icon resource, so both readings agree.
//
// Provenance and the regeneration recipe: src/gui/wx/res/README.md

x64base_icon ICON "x64base.ico"
